# @mswjs/socket.io-binding@0.2.0 declares a peer dependency on msw ^2.10.2 while
# this project runs msw v3. The binding works against v3 — see ARCHITECTURE.md,
# "Tempo real" — but npm refuses the tree without this. Pinned here so a clean
# checkout installs with a plain `npm install`.
legacy-peer-deps=true
